--- ECB interpretation note ---
The od '*' between 0000016 and 0000080 means bytes 16-79 are FOUR IDENTICAL
16-byte ciphertext blocks (four identical 'A'*16 plaintext blocks -> four
identical ECB blocks). CBC shows four different blocks. This is the leak.
